	3. Detailed Page Specifications & Sitemap
3.1 Home Page (/)
* Hero Section: High-impact hero headline incorporating the core tagline. Dynamic glow or border accents powered by #ADF802. Includes primary call-to-action button routing to /contact.
* Value Overview: Highlighting the core mission of delivering high-velocity, scalable web products.
* Services Grid: Overview cards detailing the 5 primary agency offerings. Each card links directly to its respective sub-page route.
* Core Process Workflow: Interactive 4-step agency execution path:
   1. Discovery: Project alignment & technical requirement mapping.
   2. Design: High-fidelity UI/UX design & design system architecture.
   3. Development: Clean, performant, full-stack code implementation.
   4. Launch: Quality assurance, SEO deployment, and production release.
* Final Conversion Banner: Full-width accent banner directing users to /contact.
* Explicit Exclusions: Portfolio/Work showcase section and Client Testimonials section are intentionally excluded from this release scope.
3.2 About Page (/about)
* Founder & Narrative Section: Recounts the founding and growth of Cynabyte Tech. Highlights how the agency was established by Samuel Udeala to bridge the gap between complex software design and scalable market readiness for emerging startups and businesses. 
* External Anchor Rules: The anchor link for Samuel Udeala must explicitly target https://www.linkedin.com/in/samueludeala/ and open in a new browser tab (target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer").
* Mission & Vision Pillars: Structured presentation focusing on code scalability, responsive precision, aesthetic minimalism, and measurable growth.
