   * Service: Dropdown select menu featuring the 5 agency services (Required).
   * Project Detail / Note: Textarea input field (Required).
* Primary Form Action (WhatsApp Automated Link):
   * Clicking the primary action button formats the form fields into an encoded string and opens a direct WhatsApp chat window targeting +2348148146268.
   * Payload URL Format: https://wa.me/2348148146268?text=I%20am%20[Name],%20inquiring%20about%20your%20[Service]%20service.%0A%0A[Project%20Detail%20/%20Note]
* Secondary Form Action (Email Mailto Trigger):
   * Clicking the secondary email button formats the form inputs into standard mailto syntax.
   * Subject Syntax: New Project Inquiry - [Service]
   * Body Syntax: I am [Name], inquiring about your [Service] service.%0A%0A[Project Detail / Note]
4. Technical Specifications, Performance & SEO
Technical Micro-Interactions & Styling
* Animations: Scroll-triggered element fade-ins, smooth page transitions, and subtle hover scale/glow effects leveraging #ADF802 box-shadow properties.
* Component Styling: Glassmorphic cards with subtle semi-transparent borders. High contrast contrast ratios complying with WCAG AAA accessibility standards.
Search Engine & Structured Data Engine
* Schema.org Integration: Embed complete Organization and LocalBusiness JSON-LD payloads into document heads.
* Metadata Stack: Dynamic Open Graph (OG) tag generation, Twitter Card markup, clean semantic HTML5 sectioning (<header>, <nav>, <main>, <article>, <footer>), and auto-generated XML sitemaps.
* Performance Benchmark: Mobile-first responsive grid optimized to achieve 90+ ratings on Google Lighthouse for Performance, Accessibility, Best Practices, and SEO.